title: Nutanix Prism: General Info about a Cluster (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check returns general information about the cluster, in particular its name and
 firmware version.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

discovery:
 One service is created if the configured server can be reached.
